  "description": "The Outback offers the ultimate mix between trail and city biking. The power of a Yukon... but with a reliable full-suspension frame design, RockShox rear air shock, and faster rolling tires. All this comes together to make for an exhilarating and comfortable riding experience, all in a very well priced package. Its powerful Bafang 500w (750w peak) motor paired with a 48v 20Ah Li-ion battery (with optional 25Ah upgrade) ensures that your trip can go the full distance at full speed.\nThe Outback is now available in a Large (18.5\" frame with 26 x 3.0 tires) and a smaller (16.5\" frame with 26 x 3.0 tires) for riders as small as 5'3\"\nThe Outback can be built as the FatBack with a 26\" x 4.0 fat tire option. This includes the wider rim we use on the Yukon 750 bikes. This offers extra stability, and also makes it easier to find winter tires in this more common tire size.",
